# ── Project-wide patterns (migrated from .git/info/exclude) ──
# Backup files
**/*.bak.*
# Generated report / summary files (not source of truth)
**/*-report-*.md
**/*-report.md
**/*-summary.md
# Tauri experiment (rejected — see distribution-update-system-plan memory)
src-tauri/
# Binary build artifact
server/server.binary.ts
build-bun-binary.sh
# Secret keys
.security-key
logs/security/
# Local-only design mockups (board-zai parallel design system — design artifact)
docs/design/mockups/wireloom/
# scripts/ is repo tooling — tracked by default (lint + tsc cover it).
# Local exceptions only: `_*` prefix is the scratch/measurement convention;
# everything else here is a regenerable artifact or a local-only leftover.
scripts/_*
scripts/code-finder/
scripts/index.scip
scripts/empty-env.json
scripts/build-desktop.sh
scripts/test_mcp.sh
scripts/test_mcp_direct.py
scripts/verify-pin-rail.mjs

# ── MDT working state (consolidated) — canonical list: docs/MDT_WORKING_STATE_FILES.md ──
# Hand-maintained here; the same list is scaffolded by `mdt-cli project init` in new projects.
# Depth convention: leading / anchors to project root; **/ matches at any depth.
# Ticket counter (written by ProjectManager.createProject at project root)
/.mdt-next
# MDT workflow context state (e.g. .mdt/workflow-context/ at project root)
/.mdt/
# spec-trace rendered projections (canonical store under .trace/ stays TRACKED)
**/*.trace.md
**/spec-trace*.md
# Pipeline state (any subfolder)
**/pipeline-state.json
**/*.pipeline-state.json
# Per-ticket working state
**/*.tasks-status.yaml
**/.checkpoint.yaml
# Agent working conventions
**/poc/
**/*prompt*.md
# Broad dot-file agent state (kept in this repo for tool configs like .auto-claude-security.json;
# deliberately NOT part of the init scaffold — see docs/MDT_WORKING_STATE_FILES.md)
**/.*.json
**/.*.yaml
# Ticket files must stay trackable even when a slug collides with a pattern above
!docs/CRs/MDT-*.md
